+\code{metadata(x)$JointRPCA[[name]]}.
+
+Output from \code{.joint_rpca()} with extra fields when \code{x} is a
+\code{MultiAssayExperiment}:
+\itemize{
+\item \code{$experiment_names}: character vector of experiments used.
